WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.480
You're halfway through a paragraph
when an agent finishes.

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:07.340
Switch apps to reply,
and you've lost your place.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.460
With Agent Island,
hover at the top of the screen

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:13.340
and ask Codex to add a Windows example,

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.690
right in the same conversation.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.300
Even with the island tucked away,
Codex keeps working.

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.540
Your other agents gather here too,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.150
each with its own conversations.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.690
Open the island and the blue tracks show
which tasks are running.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.170
For the full picture, open the desktop app.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:34.260
When you step away from your desk,

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.280
you can follow the same task on your phone.

00:00:37.820 --> 00:00:39.310
Once the guide is ready,

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:42.650
a notification tells you Codex has finished.

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:45.220
So the next time an agent needs you,

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:48.060
a glance and a reply are all it takes.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:50.180
That paragraph you were reading?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.960
It's right where you left it.
